OL,3,GNEWSAWomen invited to join periods
OL,4,Aresearch project
OL,5,
OL,6,FBiB's Salma Chopdat said: "The idea
OL,7,Freally came from recognising that
OL,8,Fmenstrual health has been overlooked
OL,9,Ffor a very long time in research and
OL,10,Fclinical practice."
